},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "|cffff80ff|Htransmogappearance:302687|h[Peacekeeper's Mail]|h|r has been added to your appearance collection.",
["id"] = "s1_2614",
["timestamp"] = 1794377205,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong says: Wait, yes... this crystal! Valennia, is this...",
["id"] = "s1_2615",
["timestamp"] = 1794377236,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: ...a recall crystal! Used to record an important moment, no doubt.",
["id"] = "s1_2616",
["timestamp"] = 1794377240,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong says: This is surely what the turncoat hoped to offer us in exchange for our protection.",
["id"] = "s1_2617",
["timestamp"] = 1794377244,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: The recall crystal is badly damaged, though. The recording is likely to be incomplete, so we must listen carefully.",
["id"] = "s1_2618",
["timestamp"] = 1794377250,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong says: Activate it, Valennia. We need to learn as much as we can about what it contains.",
["id"] = "s1_2619",
["timestamp"] = 1794377258,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "High Priestess Lorthuna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "High Priestess Lorthuna says: ...do not delay. Muster our forces to march immediately. The pylons are key and...the wards...come down. This is...",
["id"] = "s1_2620",
["timestamp"] = 1794377265,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "High Priestess Lorthuna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "High Priestess Lorthuna says: ...quickly. With our forces.....will be exposed.....my ritual must not....",
["id"] = "s1_2621",
["timestamp"] = 1794377274,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "High Priestess Lorthuna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "High Priestess Lorthuna says: I alone am.....this task....the Windlord will.......our voices.....he will come.....we must not fail!",
["id"] = "s1_2622",
["timestamp"] = 1794377281,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: The crystal is too damaged to play any further, I am afraid.",
["id"] = "s1_2623",
["timestamp"] = 1794377289,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong says: Wards... what is this about wards, Valennia?",
["id"] = "s1_2624",
["timestamp"] = 1794377295,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: The anchor pylons keep us suspended in this realm, but they also act as wards! The Shal'nan once spoke of this. They keep us shielded from...",
["id"] = "s1_2625",
["timestamp"] = 1794377299,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: With the cult running roughshod over most of the island with impunity, Lorthuna undoubtedly thinks we are on the back foot. We can use that overconfidence against her.",
["id"] = "s1_2626",
["timestamp"] = 1794377301,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong says: ...whatever else is out there in Skywall. Spirits save us... this is her plan. Bring down the wards and let her 'Windlord' in!",
["id"] = "s1_2627",
["timestamp"] = 1794377309,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: I believe that with a proper distraction at the shrine, a small force of Peacekeepers, Windshapers, and High Order should be able to push up a flank and break into the inner sanctum. From there, we take out the High Priestess herself and cut the head off the snake.",
["id"] = "s1_2628",
["timestamp"] = 1794377310,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonshaman-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: Go and speak with the leaders of the Windshapers and the High Order, respectively. They don't get along, but I think they can recognize that the bigger threat is the Al'Aketh. Get them to agree to the plan and then return here.",
["id"] = "s1_2629",
["timestamp"] = 1794377325,
},
