["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: Once your campfire is down, you can place all sorts of camp fixtures around it.",
["id"] = "s1_3014",
["timestamp"] = 1794457668,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: Sufficiently skilled leatherworkers, for example, can place a tent like this one behind me.",
["id"] = "s1_3015",
["timestamp"] = 1794457674,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: Every trade has something they can contribute to your camp, even fishermen!",
["id"] = "s1_3016",
["timestamp"] = 1794457681,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: Then, all you need to do is have a seat near the fire and soak it all in. After a few minutes of resting, you'll gain various boons that will help you in your travels.",
["id"] = "s1_3017",
["timestamp"] = 1794457686,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: If you just sit still and rest for a few more moments, you'll gain a benefit from having rested near the tent I have set up behind me.",
["id"] = "s1_3018",
["timestamp"] = 1794457697,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: That's about the gist of it. Once you've gained your boon from resting near the fire, speak with me again.",
["id"] = "s1_3019",
["timestamp"] = 1794457705,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Skyborne",
["name"] = "Ari Santo",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["level"] = 6,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE",
["type"] = "EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Ari Santo:318:TEXT_EMOTE:|h|cff0070ddAri Santo|r|h tells a joke to Raan Wildwind.",
["id"] = "s1_3020",
["timestamp"] = 1794457717,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
