},
["text"] = "Your skill in Daggers has increased to 39.",
["timestamp"] = 1794464819,
["id"] = "s1_3570",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: As you know, our way of life is in grave danger. Since the elementals vanished, our people have been in a state of steady decline.",
["timestamp"] = 1794464954,
["id"] = "s1_3571",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The Al'Aketh are a symptom of this. In many ways they are a dark mirror into the hearts of the Windshapers. Many of us believe that we are to blame for the spirits leaving us.",
["timestamp"] = 1794464962,
["id"] = "s1_3572",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Whatever the cause, we need to find a solution quickly before we tear ourselves apart. Tell me, what do you know of Kalimdor?",
["timestamp"] = 1794464972,
["id"] = "s1_3573",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Endaria Mistgaze",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Endaria Mistgaze says: Oh, and a word of warning before you head up to Shadowgale Forest. It's incredibly dangerous up there. Some even say it's haunted. Make sure you are prepared and well-equipped if you plan to make the trek.",
["timestamp"] = 1794464973,
["id"] = "s1_3574",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The cradle of our people is now part of an even larger world known as \"Azeroth\". There are those on Azeroth possessing a skysight so strong that they can pierce the heavens themselves to see beyond.",
["timestamp"] = 1794464979,
["id"] = "s1_3575",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Shamans, much like myself, but orders of magnitude more powerful. This power and their knowledge of the elemental planes is the key to our survival.",
["timestamp"] = 1794464990,
["id"] = "s1_3576",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: In my own clumsy searching throughout the planes for signs of our elemental benefactors, I stumbled upon them...",
["timestamp"] = 1794464998,
["id"] = "s1_3577",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: An entire order of visionaries just like the Windshapers called The Earthen Ring. One of their leaders, a shaman named Muln Earthfury, has shown me much.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465005,
["id"] = "s1_3578",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: I have seen the way. We must return to Kalimdor, confer with this Earthen Ring. They will help us master the skysight so that we may call our elemental patrons back home.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465014,
["id"] = "s1_3579",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: However, this journey will be dangerous. We need strong, able-bodied young shen'dorei to join us as we explore this massive new world. Those just like you, in fact.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465023,
["id"] = "s1_3580",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: You do not need to agree to this now. When the time comes, however, please consider joining us in our expedition. Until we speak again... may the winds guide your path.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465032,
["id"] = "s1_3581",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riaani Nightwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Riaani Nightwind says: This construct might as well be a paperweight. Someone stole some of its most important components.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465086,
["id"] = "s1_3582",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riaani Nightwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Riaani Nightwind says: Replacement parts are hard to come by these days, with how few intact constructs we have left on the island.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465092,
["id"] = "s1_3583",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riaani Nightwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Riaani Nightwind says: If you want to try and find the components we need, I won't stop you, but it might require more than a little bit of scavenging.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465098,
["id"] = "s1_3584",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riaani Nightwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Riaani Nightwind says: Shrieklings tend to hoard shiny things in their lairs, so it's possible some construct parts may have ended up in the shriekling cave just west of Valanaar.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465106,
["id"] = "s1_3585",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riaani Nightwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Riaani Nightwind says: Constructs used to help us trawl Windsong Lake and when the pylons started to fail, many fell into the depths. There may be usable parts on the lakebed if you are up for a swim.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465115,
["id"] = "s1_3586",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riaani Nightwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Riaani Nightwind says: Lastly, the bandit highwaymen common in the Gustberry Lowlands are known to hoard a variety of junk at their camps. Construct parts are likely to be found among such loot.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465125,
["id"] = "s1_3587",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simondruid-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_SKILL",
["type"] = "SKILL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.3333333432674408,
["g"] = 0.3333333432674408,
["b"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Your skill in Herbalism has increased to 36.",
["timestamp"] = 1794465194,
["id"] = "s1_3588",
},
