},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: Oh, and for you in particular, druid. Our scouts learned of your involvement with what happened to the magister, Belathaan Brightwish. If we know, the High Order surely knows as well.",
