},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: Go on and have a seat near the fire and we can get started.",
["timestamp"] = 1794538078,
["id"] = "s1_4311",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: All you need to start a camp of your own is a basic campfire. Cooks can generally teach you how to make one of those.",
["timestamp"] = 1794538083,
["id"] = "s1_4312",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: Once your campfire is down, you can place all sorts of camp fixtures around it.",
["timestamp"] = 1794538091,
["id"] = "s1_4313",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: Every trade has something they can contribute to your camp, even fishermen!",
["timestamp"] = 1794538107,
["id"] = "s1_4314",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: Then, all you need to do is have a seat near the fire and soak it all in. After a few minutes of resting, you'll gain various boons that will help you in your travels.",
["timestamp"] = 1794538109,
["id"] = "s1_4315",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: If you just sit still and rest for a few more moments, you'll gain a benefit from having rested near the tent I have set up behind me.",
["timestamp"] = 1794538119,
["id"] = "s1_4316",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Raan Wildwind",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Raan Wildwind says: That's about the gist of it. Once you've gained your boon from resting near the fire, speak with me again.",
["timestamp"] = 1794538128,
["id"] = "s1_4317",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_SKILL",
["type"] = "SKILL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.3333333432674408,
["g"] = 0.3333333432674408,
["b"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "You have gained the Cooking skill.",
["timestamp"] = 1794538220,
["id"] = "s1_4318",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Constable Aonda",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
