["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: As you know, our way of life is in grave danger. Since the elementals vanished, our people have been in a state of steady decline.",
["id"] = "s1_4849",
["timestamp"] = 1794543650,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Scourge",
["name"] = "Aes Bavits",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "MAGE",
["level"] = 32,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1345:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: GRMdots tagging makes it kind crazy for you",
["id"] = "s1_4850",
["timestamp"] = 1794543655,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The Al'Aketh are a symptom of this. In many ways they are a dark mirror into the hearts of the Windshapers. Many of us believe that we are to blame for the spirits leaving us.",
["id"] = "s1_4851",
["timestamp"] = 1794543658,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Troll",
["name"] = "Davoodoo Man",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "WARLOCK",
["level"] = 30,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1347:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: GRMboom got em down",
["id"] = "s1_4852",
["timestamp"] = 1794543665,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Whatever the cause, we need to find a solution quickly before we tear ourselves apart. Tell me, what do you know of Kalimdor?",
["id"] = "s1_4853",
["timestamp"] = 1794543668,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Troll",
["name"] = "Davoodoo Man",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "WARLOCK",
["level"] = 30,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1349:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: GRMmulti pulling ftw",
["id"] = "s1_4854",
["timestamp"] = 1794543674,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: The cradle of our people is now part of an even larger world known as \"Azeroth\". There are those on Azeroth possessing a skysight so strong that they can pierce the heavens themselves to see beyond.",
["id"] = "s1_4855",
["timestamp"] = 1794543675,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: Shamans, much like myself, but orders of magnitude more powerful. This power and their knowledge of the elemental planes is the key to our survival.",
["id"] = "s1_4856",
["timestamp"] = 1794543686,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: In my own clumsy searching throughout the planes for signs of our elemental benefactors, I stumbled upon them...",
["id"] = "s1_4857",
["timestamp"] = 1794543694,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: An entire order of visionaries just like the Windshapers called The Earthen Ring. One of their leaders, a shaman named Muln Earthfury, has shown me much.",
["id"] = "s1_4858",
["timestamp"] = 1794543701,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Troll",
["name"] = "Davoodoo Man",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "WARLOCK",
["level"] = 30,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1355:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: GRMbet you'll never know what thats like, MAGE",
["id"] = "s1_4859",
["timestamp"] = 1794543702,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Troll",
["name"] = "Davoodoo Man",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "WARLOCK",
["level"] = 30,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1356:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: GRMhahahaha",
["id"] = "s1_4860",
["timestamp"] = 1794543705,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: I have seen the way. We must return to Kalimdor, confer with this Earthen Ring. They will help us master the skysight so that we may call our elemental patrons back home.",
["id"] = "s1_4861",
["timestamp"] = 1794543710,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: However, this journey will be dangerous. We need strong, able-bodied young shen'dorei to join us as we explore this massive new world. Those just like you, in fact.",
["id"] = "s1_4862",
["timestamp"] = 1794543719,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Scourge",
["name"] = "Aes Bavits",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "MAGE",
["level"] = 32,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aes Bavits:1359:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebAes Bavits|r]|h: GRMTHE COCOON! NOOOOO",
["id"] = "s1_4863",
["timestamp"] = 1794543728,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Ayessa Dawnsinger says: You do not need to agree to this now. When the time comes, however, please consider joining us in our expedition. Until we speak again... may the winds guide your path.",
["id"] = "s1_4864",
["timestamp"] = 1794543728,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Troll",
["name"] = "Davoodoo Man",
["sex"] = 2,
["class"] = "WARLOCK",
["level"] = 30,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Davoodoo Man:1365:GUILD:|h[|cff8788eeDavoodoo Man|r]|h: GRM?",
["id"] = "s1_4865",
["timestamp"] = 1794543739,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Endaria Mistgaze",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Endaria Mistgaze says: Oh, and a word of warning before you head up to Shadowgale Forest. It's incredibly dangerous up there. Some even say it's haunted. Make sure you are prepared and well-equipped if you plan to make the trek.",
["id"] = "s1_4866",
["timestamp"] = 1794543746,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
