{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong says: Wards... what is this about wards, Valennia?",
["timestamp"] = 1794552230,
["id"] = "s2_3068",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: With the cult running roughshod over most of the island with impunity, Lorthuna undoubtedly thinks we are on the back foot. We can use that overconfidence against her.",
["timestamp"] = 1794552234,
["id"] = "s2_3069",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: The anchor pylons keep us suspended in this realm, but they also act as wards! The Shal'nan once spoke of this. They keep us shielded from...",
["timestamp"] = 1794552235,
["id"] = "s2_3070",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: I believe that with a proper distraction at the shrine, a small force of Peacekeepers, Windshapers, and High Order should be able to push up a flank and break into the inner sanctum. From there, we take out the High Priestess herself and cut the head off the snake.",
["timestamp"] = 1794552243,
["id"] = "s2_3071",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Talaanis Shadowsong says: ...whatever else is out there in Skywall. Spirits save us... this is her plan. Bring down the wards and let her 'Windlord' in!",
["timestamp"] = 1794552245,
["id"] = "s2_3072",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Valennia Stormfist",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Valennia Stormfist says: Go and speak with the leaders of the Windshapers and the High Order, respectively. They don't get along, but I think they can recognize that the bigger threat is the Al'Aketh. Get them to agree to the plan and then return here.",
["timestamp"] = 1794552258,
["id"] = "s2_3073",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Simonhunter-Windseeker",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "High Order Mage",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "High Order Mage says: Watch yourself. The High Order will not tolerate hostility in our lodge.",
["timestamp"] = 1794552418,
["id"] = "s2_3074",
},
